" knowledge base (the \"system\" you are looking at). The second documents "
"the **OpenResty/ngx_lua runtime**, with a C4 view of the DNS-resolution path"
" that is verified against nginx 1.31.1 / ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5 in this tree."
