#: ../../02-architecture.md:85 2f575f682c594cce941ff358b0c51d3c
msgid ""
"Who runs this OpenResty: each reader or operator installs and runs OpenResty"
" per [Quick Start](01-quick-start.md); this tree documents the behavior but "
"does not run a server itself. External systems a typical OpenResty app may "
"call are backends such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, Redis, Memcached, DNS, or "
"upstream HTTP services, accessed non-blockingly through cosockets."
msgstr ""
"谁运行这套 OpenResty：每位读者或运维人员按[快速上手](01-quick-start.md)安装并运行 "
"OpenResty；本源码树记录其行为，本身并不运行服务器。典型的 OpenResty 应用可能调用的外部系统是 "
"MySQL、PostgreSQL、Redis、Memcached、DNS 或上游 HTTP 服务等后端，全部通过 cosocket 非阻塞访问。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:91 bbdaa469bb5649fb8ef9dd3b5d7dd51f
msgid ""
"What this tree does contain (as documented facts): nginx 1.31.1 plus the "
"OpenResty Lua modules under `openresty/bundle/`. Hostname connects from Lua "
"do not use the system resolver. They use Nginx `ngx_resolver` and the "
"nameservers from the `resolver` directive."
msgstr ""
"本源码树记录的事实：nginx 1.31.1 以及 `openresty/bundle/` 下的 OpenResty Lua 模块。来自 Lua "
"的主机名连接不使用系统解析器，而是使用 Nginx `ngx_resolver` 和 `resolver` 指令指定的域名服务器。"

