msgid ""
"There are no other deployable containers in this tree; the PKB ships only "
"the documentation. Operators may add the usual OpenResty containers (Nginx "
"workers, Redis/MySQL backends) at run time."
msgstr ""
"本源码树没有其他可部署容器；知识库只随附文档。运维人员可在运行时自行添加常见的 OpenResty 容器（Nginx "
"worker、Redis/MySQL 后端）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:114 909238633140469e89c2ce520dd12768
msgid "Component View"
msgstr "组件视图"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:116 1faa4540cd4a4d6488b6a8b2193317cb
msgid "Resolver and cosocket"
msgstr "解析器与 cosocket"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:118 6e71daa34ba844c0b03f4b439d3606d2
msgid ""
"**Responsibilities**: Map a hostname to addresses, cache successful answers "
"in per-resolver red-black trees, and fail or resume every request waiting on"
" that name."
msgstr "**职责**：将主机名映射为地址，在每个解析器的红黑树中缓存成功应答，并让所有等待该名字的请求失败或恢复。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:119 c70cd1a475cb4b5a8c74bfa7d263091a
msgid ""
"**Key entry points**: `ngx_http_lua_socket_tcp_connect`, "
"`ngx_resolve_start`, `ngx_resolve_name`, `ngx_resolver_process_response`, "
"`ngx_http_lua_socket_resolve_handler`, `ngx_http_upstream_resolve_handler`."
msgstr ""
"**关键入口**：`ngx_http_lua_socket_tcp_connect`、`ngx_resolve_start`、`ngx_resolve_name`、`ngx_resolver_process_response`、`ngx_http_lua_socket_resolve_handler`、`ngx_http_upstream_resolve_handler`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:120 e8bce91552c7462f84eae1306682023c
msgid ""
"**Important dependencies**: The `resolver` directive on the location or "
"upstream. IPv6 queries are on unless `ipv6=off` (`r->ipv6` defaults to 1). A"
" second nameserver is only a failover target for send failure and for the "
"5-second resend timer, not for SERVFAIL."
msgstr ""
"**重要依赖**：位于 location 或 upstream 上的 `resolver` 指令。除非设置 `ipv6=off`（`r->ipv6` "
"默认为 1），否则 IPv6 查询开启。第二个域名服务器仅是发送失败和 5 秒重发定时器时的故障转移目标，而不是 SERVFAIL 时的目标。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:121 8c3baad9f4f0469da562c86c1c50b421
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: Missing resolver, query timeout, non-zero RCODE, CNAME "
"chain longer than 50, or a dropped malformed packet that later hits "
"`resolver_timeout`. See [Workflows](06-workflows.md)."
msgstr ""
"**失败模式**：缺少 resolver、查询超时、非零 RCODE、超过 50 的 CNAME 链，或丢弃了格式错误的报文后最终触发 "
"`resolver_timeout`。参见[工作流](06-workflows.md)。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:123 51baf7b6f0934b3d9806e91f34e7a7e2
msgid ""
"`openresty/bundle/lua-resty-dns-0.23/` is a separate cosocket DNS client. It"
" does not replace `ngx_resolver` unless Lua calls it and then connects to "
"the resulting address itself."
msgstr ""
"`openresty/bundle/lua-resty-dns-0.23/` 是一个独立的 cosocket DNS 客户端。除非 Lua "
"调用它并自行连接解析出的地址，否则它不替代 `ngx_resolver`。"

