#: ../../02-architecture.md:134 67c5bbb55ad94a55888151fef9fa5412
msgid "Key Runtime Flows"
msgstr "关键运行时流程"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:136 75847dcd4f3d487393cec0bae84712b8
msgid ""
"Success and failure steps are in [Workflows](06-workflows.md). Retry and "
"HTTP status guidance for callers is in [Conventions](07-conventions.md)."
msgstr ""
"成功和失败的步骤见[工作流](06-workflows.md)。调用方的重试和 HTTP "
"状态码指引见[开发规范](07-conventions.md)。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:139 6a9c7cb3bf62477d95d5146268fde786
msgid "Cross-Cutting Concerns"
msgstr "横切关注点"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:141 de806351e2e04c2daa990fea26365c4e
msgid ""
"**Authentication and authorization**: not applicable to this static PKB; in "
"the documented runtime, access control is implemented in Lua (usually in "
"`access_by_lua*`) rather than in the resolver path."
msgstr ""
"**认证与授权**：不适用于这个静态知识库；在所记录的运行时中，访问控制由 Lua 实现（通常在 `access_by_lua*` "
"中），而不是在解析器路径中。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 062a05ef51af4683b01b35456e2a36f1
msgid ""
"**Error handling**: Cosocket returns the error to Lua. Upstream turns "
"resolve failure into 502. See [Data and API](05-data-and-api.md)."
msgstr ""
"**错误处理**：Cosocket 将错误返回给 Lua。上游将解析失败转为 502。参见[数据与 API](05-data-and-api.md)。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:146 4d800c68d1744dd19971a5134b85d4de
msgid ""
"**Logging and tracing**: Error-log lines are listed in "
"[Observability](11-observability.md). `lua_socket_log_errors` defaults to "
"`on`."
msgstr ""
"**日志与追踪**：错误日志行列于[可观测性](11-observability.md)。`lua_socket_log_errors` 默认为 "
"`on`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:149 7348ab8b18874fdd817eaaaee8935c7f
msgid ""
"**Caching**: Successful answers stay in the name rbtree until `valid=` or "
"the record TTL. A failed RCODE deletes that node. `resolver_timeout` does "
"not control the resend interval."
msgstr ""
"**缓存**：成功应答会保留在名称红黑树中，直到 `valid=` 或记录 TTL 到期。失败的 RCODE "
"会删除该节点。`resolver_timeout` 不控制重发间隔。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:152 c9c1e841f5b64537a1ad7b8f69e84cbf
msgid ""
"**Configuration and secrets**: Nameserver addresses belong in `nginx.conf`, "
"not in source; secrets belong in environment variables or a secrets store "
"(see [Conventions](07-conventions.md))."
msgstr ""
"**配置与密钥**：域名服务器地址应放在 `nginx.conf` "
"中而非源码中；密钥应放在环境变量或密钥存储中（参见[开发规范](07-conventions.md)）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:156 e72a43053ee84dfd841bf1a62a5f62e6
msgid "Deployment and Scaling Notes"
msgstr "部署与扩容说明"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:158 db330c8ad93c4bcd8073ebd5091d9877
msgid ""
"**Environments**: this PKB does not publish resolver addresses for dev, "
"staging, or production; operators confirm the `resolver` and "
"`resolver_timeout` values for each environment (see the example in "
"[Conventions](07-conventions.md))."
msgstr ""
"**环境**：本知识库不为开发、预发或生产发布 resolver 地址；由运维人员为每个环境确认 `resolver` 和 "
"`resolver_timeout` 的值（示例见[开发规范](07-conventions.md)）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:161 2cc39430f1494891b7df37956280a2dd
msgid ""
"**Scaling model**: Each worker has its own resolver trees and in-flight "
"queries."
msgstr "**扩容模型**：每个 worker 拥有自己的解析器树和进行中的查询。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:162 e31db6a43a7746ebbb42448d3323de01
msgid ""
"**Recovery considerations**: A single nameserver is a single point of "
"failure for queries that get no UDP reply. SERVFAIL from that server still "
"fails the request without trying the next server."
msgstr ""
"**恢复考量**：对于得不到 UDP 应答的查询，单一域名服务器是单点故障。来自该服务器的 SERVFAIL 仍会使请求失败，而不会尝试下一个服务器。"

